### Netcup SCP API — ISO Management
# Attach, detach, and manage ISO images.

### Get Attached ISO
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/iso
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### List Available ISO Images for Server
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/isoimages
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Attach ISO to Server (async — returns task UUID)
POST {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/iso
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isoImageId": 0
}

### Detach ISO from Server
DELETE {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/iso
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### List User-Uploaded ISOs
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/isos
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Presigned Download URL for User ISO
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/isos/REPLACE_WITH_ISO_KEY
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Prepare ISO Upload (single part)
POST {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/isos/REPLACE_WITH_ISO_KEY?multipart=false
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Prepare ISO Upload (multipart)
POST {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/isos/REPLACE_WITH_ISO_KEY?multipart=true
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Presigned URL for Upload Part
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/isos/REPLACE_WITH_ISO_KEY/REPLACE_WITH_UPLOAD_ID/parts/REPLACE_WITH_PART_NUMBER
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Complete Multipart ISO Upload
PUT {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/isos/REPLACE_WITH_ISO_KEY/REPLACE_WITH_UPLOAD_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Delete User ISO
DELETE {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/isos/REPLACE_WITH_ISO_KEY
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
